#. type: Title =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/rgbif.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to rgbif"
msgstr "rgbif 簡介"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/rgbif.adoc:4
msgid "https://docs.ropensci.org/rgbif/[rgbif^] is an R package which gives you access to https://www.gbif.org/[GBIF mediated data^] via its https://www.gbif.org/developer/summary[REST API^]."
msgstr "https://docs.ropensci.org/rgbif/[rgbif^] 是一個 R 套件，可讓您透過其 https://www.gbif.org/developer/summary[REST API^] 存取 https://www.gbif.org/[GBIF 提供之資料^]。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/data-use/modules/ROOT/pages/rgbif.adoc:8
msgid "In this video (07:29), John Waller, GBIF Data Analyst, provides an introduction the rgbif package. If you are unable to watch the embedded Vimeo video, you can download it locally on the xref:downloads.adoc[Files for download] page."
msgstr "在這段影片（07:29）中，GBIF 資料分析師 John Waller 介紹了 rgbif 套件。若您無法觀看嵌入的 Vimeo 影片，可至 xref:downloads.adoc[可下載檔案] 頁面將影片下載至本機。"

